# Cursor Editor — Cursor Cloud (cursor.com)

## Overview

Cursor Cloud refers to the hosted infrastructure and web platform accessible at [cursor.com](https://cursor.com) that powers Cursor's agent services, team collaboration features, billing management, and cloud runtime execution. It is the backend counterpart to the local Cursor Editor.

While the Cursor Editor runs locally on your machine, Cursor Cloud handles:
- Cloud agent execution (run agents on Cursor-hosted VMs)
- Team workspace management
- Billing and subscription management
- API key and service account management
- Cursor Automations scheduling (cloud agent runs)
- Usage analytics and telemetry aggregation

