## Cursor.com Account

### Creating an Account

1. Visit [cursor.com](https://cursor.com)
2. Sign up with email or GitHub account
3. Connect the account to your Cursor IDE:
   - Open Cursor Settings
   - Navigate to the account/authentication section
   - Sign in with your cursor.com credentials

### Account Tiers

| Tier | Features | Agent Access |
|------|----------|-------------|
| **Free** | Basic editor, limited AI usage | Local agent only |
| **Pro** | Full editor, cloud agent, unlimited usage | Local + Cloud agent |
| **Enterprise** | Team management, SSO, admin controls, audit logs | All tiers + team features |

### Account Linking

When you sign in to Cursor with your cursor.com account:

1. Cursor generates an authentication token linked to your account
2. The token is stored securely in Cursor's user data directory
3. Cloud agent runs, team settings, and billing are tied to your account
4. The IDE checks for account validity periodically

