## Billing and Subscriptions

### Subscription Tiers

| Tier | Pricing Model | Cloud Agent Minutes | Team Seats |
|------|--------------|---------------------|------------|
| **Free** | $0/month | None | 1 |
| **Pro** | Per-user subscription | Included | 1-3 |
| **Enterprise** | Custom pricing | Unlimited | Unlimited |

### Billing Features

- **Seat management**: Add/remove team members
- **Usage analytics**: Track agent runs, token usage, cloud compute hours
- **Invoice history**: Download invoices for accounting
- **Payment methods**: Credit card, corporate billing
- **Usage alerts**: Set thresholds for spend notification

### Cloud Agent Dashboard

Access via [cursor.com/dashboard?tab=cloud-agents](https://cursor.com/dashboard?tab=cloud-agents)

