## Personal vs Team Resources

### Resource Ownership

| Resource | Personal | Team |
|----------|----------|------|
| User API key | Owns | — |
| Team service account key | — | Owned by team |
| Custom subagents (`~/.cursor/agents/`) | Owns | Inherited by all team members |
| Custom subagents (`.cursor/agents/`) | — | Owned by repo, shared |
| Skills (`~/.cursor/skills/`) | Owns | Inherited by all team members |
| Skills (`.cursor/skills/`) | — | Owned by repo, shared |
| Dashboard MCP servers | Assigned to user | Shared across team |
| Cloud agent runs | Billed to user | Billed to team |

### Sync Mechanism

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Team Admin
    participant Cloud as cursor.com
    participant IDE as Cursor IDE
    
    Admin->>Cloud: Update team settings
    Cloud->>Cloud: Persist team config
    Cloud->>IDE: Sync team settings
    IDE->>IDE: Apply team config
    Note over IDE: IDE respects team overrides
    IDE->>Admin: Agent runs use team models/keys
```

