## Workspace Configuration

### Creating a Workspace

1. Navigate to [cursor.com/dashboard](https://cursor.com/dashboard)
2. Click "New Workspace" or "Create Team"
3. Configure workspace name and team identifier
4. Set workspace-level agent settings
5. Invite team members

### Workspace Settings Structure

```json
{
  "workspace": {
    "name": "My Team",
    "id": "team_abc123",
    "settings": {
      "agent": {
        "chatModel": "claude-sonnet-4-20250514",
        "agentModel": "claude-opus-4-20250514",
        "contextWindow": 200000
      },
      "provider": {
        "default": "anthropic",
        "apiKey": "team_api_key_..."
      },
      "billing": {
        "plan": "enterprise",
        "seats": 10,
        "usageLimit": 10000
      }
    }
  }
}
```

