## Troubleshooting

### Common Issues

| Issue | Cause | Solution |
|-------|-------|----------|
| Account not syncing | Auth token expired | Re-sign in at cursor.com/dashboard |
| Team settings not applying | Local override exists | Check workspace settings for conflicting values |
| Cloud agent not starting | Insufficient credits | Check billing status at cursor.com/dashboard/integrations |
| Service account key not working | Wrong scope | Verify key is a team service account key, not personal |
| MCP server not shared | Not dashboard-backed | Server must have `dashboard-` or `plugin-` prefix |

### Diagnostics

```bash
# Check current account status
# Visit: https://cursor.com/dashboard

# Verify team membership
# Visit: https://cursor.com/dashboard/teams

# Check API key validity
curl -H "Authorization: Bearer $CURSOR_API_KEY" \
  https://api.cursor.com/v1/agent/status

# List team members
# Visit: https://cursor.com/dashboard/teams/<teamId>/members
```

